Challenge 2 — Memory Leak Issue
Situation

During reconciliation processing, application memory usage continuously increased and system became slow after processing large transaction files.

Root Cause

We found dynamically allocated memory was not released properly in some transaction-processing loops.
Transaction *txn = new Transaction();

// processing

// delete missing

This caused memory leaks during bulk transaction processing.

How You Fixed It

I analyzed the issue using GDB and manual log tracing.
Then I identified objects allocated using new without corresponding delete.

Fixed code:

Transaction *txn = new Transaction();

// processing

delete txn;
txn = NULL;


